o_themes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/configured_pomodoro_themes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-dk[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-dk/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli themes config, hue rule, and catalog reports[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: parse and validate the `themes:` block, put config colors first [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in the hue rule, add `configured` to every ThemeRef, make `bob themes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list` and `bob themes color` config-aware, extend the hue vectors, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document PT12.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli suggestions and warnings for unconfigured themes[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]warnings[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]warnings: limit Recent suggestions to configured themes and emit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`theme_not_configured` from capture, Name-it, bob plan, rename/split, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and themes-list hints, plus menu vectors and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins configured-theme rendering, pickers, and lints[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]obsidian[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config, warnings[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]obsidian: decode the new report fields, mirror the hue rule and menu [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scoping in JS, badge unconfigured create rows, mark unconfigured ledger [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chips, update the theme manager, and add the plan-block lint.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture configured-theme rendering and warnings[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config, warnings[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: render `configured: false` themes with the dashed treatment, badge [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unconfigured create rows, show `theme_not_configured` in every preview [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and in Name-it without flicker, and scope Name-it chips to configured [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]themes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bryan's six configured themes in chezmoi[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]dotfiles[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dotfiles: add the six-theme `themes:` block with the chosen colors to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the chezmoi bob config, check it with the new parser, and apply it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-dk","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-dk.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2cce353762a06ef2ce74f17531597c6b","started_at":"2026-10-28T11:51:04.538170+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"066eb61e6f1a3ad2a1a49775de63fdf4f7744fb131167f86c7931b6a1e961c6b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-dk.2--1/chat.md","size_bytes":10147},"commits":{"digest":"da7df1fe75a72919a3de19bc05b5c13f9a83ac76ae6d673de691380f74d25237","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-dk.2--1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"6b33f3e1e6c22a0e0fbbe548c7bce5779ada907b3e1adf582bd77f950d83b27a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-dk.2--